  "endpoint": "Native coding verification and independent EVALUATOR evidence plus separate behavioral oracle; external PR/publication boundaries are operator handoffs, never automatic success.",
  "limits": [
    "Linux x86_64 Landlock ABI 4 is required; unsupported hosts fail closed.",
    "Pure synchronous ES-module solve API; no imports. VM isolates invocation framing; Landlock confines the whole child.",
    "Host callbacks authenticate native evidence and per-role writable roots; arbitrary caller JSON is not evidence.",
    "Native approval, retention and uncertain-effect boundaries require the emitted operator route. Retained checkpoints never silently replay.",
    "Managed app-server startup was probed without generation. Actual authenticated campaign runtime, pins and quota must be qualified in its frozen task.",
    "Network-enabled provider mode permits IP networking; it does not enforce provider-domain-only egress.",
    "Offline reference solutions and transport doubles are not observed model outcomes or efficiency evidence.",
    "Canonical item attempts and all retained semantic episodes are reconciled against assignment calls. Missing execution, retries or history fail closed; externally performed episodes cannot be certified by this host."
  ]
